      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.13,
          "end": 6.24,
          "en": "DALL-E 2 is OpenAI's text-to-image tool,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 6.24,
          "end": 9.39,
          "en": "and therefore, I'm back on the OpenAI website.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 9.39,
          "end": 14.19,
          "en": "And there, we can also find information about DALL-E 2.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 14.19,
          "end": 15.72,
          "en": "All you need to get started",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 15.72,
          "end": 18.897,
          "en": "with this tool is an OpenAI account,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 18.897,
          "end": 21.45,
          "en": "and in case you followed along this course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 21.45,
          "end": 23.97,
          "en": "you should have such an account already.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 23.97,
          "end": 28.29,
          "en": "Therefore, we can simply try DALL-E 2 together now.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 28.29,
          "end": 30.69,
          "en": "One important thing about DALL-E 2",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 30.69,
          "end": 32.52,
          "en": "before we get started though,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 32.52,
          "end": 37.2,
          "en": "just as Midjourney, DALL-E 2 is not for free.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 37.2,
          "end": 39.93,
          "en": "Midjourney is a monthly subscription,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 39.93,
          "end": 42.24,
          "en": "so you pay for the minutes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 42.24,
          "end": 45.78,
          "en": "you consume that it takes to generate the images.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 45.78,
          "end": 48.453,
          "en": "DALL-E 2 uses a credit system.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 49.35,
          "end": 51.999,
          "en": "In your user profile,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 51.999,
          "end": 55.947,
          "en": "you can see your current credits that you have",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 55.947,
          "end": 59.4,
          "en": "and you can also buy more credits.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 59.4,
          "end": 62.4,
          "en": "Each operation you perform in DALL-E 2",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 62.4,
          "end": 65.34,
          "en": "like generating images, editing images,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 65.34,
          "end": 69.03,
          "en": "and so on costs you around about one credit.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 69.03,
          "end": 72.99,
          "en": "Therefore, DALL-E 2 is definitely not cheap.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 72.99,
          "end": 74.94,
          "en": "So, it's up on you to decide",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 74.94,
          "end": 77.46000000000001,
          "en": "if you want to buy some credits here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 77.46000000000001,
          "end": 79.53,
          "en": "or if you just want to follow along the videos",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 79.53,
          "end": 82.563,
          "en": "to learn how DALL-E 2 generally works.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 83.52,
          "end": 85.2,
          "en": "With that out of the way,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 85.2,
          "end": 88.5,
          "en": "let's go back to the starting page, so to say.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 88.5,
          "end": 93.18,
          "en": "And there, you see an important positive aspect of DALL-E 2.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 93.18,
          "end": 96.63300000000001,
          "en": "The user interface is very simple and straightforward.",
